#: src/mediaforge/web/templates/settings.html:509
msgid ""
"MediaForge no longer rescans everything on every start — on a large "
"library that costs minutes for a result that is almost always identical. "
"While it runs, the file watcher picks up changes live; this interval "
"covers what the watcher cannot, such as files added while MediaForge was "
"closed. Locations that have never been scanned are always read in, and "
"the refresh button on the Library page rescans on demand."
msgstr ""

